# Mzansi Visa Solutions

- API (`backend/`) is the source of truth. Do not hardcode services, FAQs, statuses, or marketing copy in `web/` or `mobile/`.
- No TypeScript `any` / `as any` / `Record<string, any>`.
- No fake production clients or applications in UI. Seed only via `python manage.py seed_platform`.
- Enforce permissions in Django. Frontend guards are UX only.
- Documents are private. Never serve uploads as public static files.
- Never promise guaranteed visa or permanent residence approval.
- Payments stay provider-agnostic (`apps/payments/providers.py`).
